---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Changelog | Starbucks Nutrition Calculator"
  description="What changed, and when, in the Starbucks Nutrition Calculator's dataset and application."
  path="/changelog/"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
      <div class="section__heading">
        <p class="section__eyebrow">Changelog</p>
        <h1>Data &amp; product changelog</h1>
      </div>

      <article style="margin-bottom:32px;">
        <h2>2026.09-seed</h2>
        <p>Initial release.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Calculator engine, drink/size/milk/espresso/syrup/sauce/whip/topping customization architecture.</li>
          <li>
            Seed dataset of 11 U.S. drinks, compiled from publicly available Starbucks nutrition figures via third-party trackers and marked <code
              >needs-review</code
            > pending direct verification against starbucks.com.
          </li>
          <li>Save, favorite, recent drinks and shareable URL state (all client-side, in the browser).</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Known gaps (tracked, not fabricated)</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Per-pump syrup and sauce nutrition: not yet verified for any drink.</li>
          <li>Per-drink milk-substitution nutrition deltas: not yet verified.</li>
          <li>Food items and seasonal drinks: not yet in the dataset.</li>
          <li>
            Java Chip Frappuccino and several other popular items: excluded from this release because third-party sources disagreed enough on the figures that
            we chose not to publish a number.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
